ginal":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rfzU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1e4075f7-6608-43ba-a573-07b306104b26","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"ありがとうございます、ライブラリ側のコンポーネントでスタイルがいろいろ調整できるときのpropsとの使い分けってどうされてます？","ts":"1635584055.221800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zCI9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"99cd6b58-936b-405f-8e9c-eb425f00fb50","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"はい、まさにそんな感じで使ってます","ts":"1635583855.221000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CjE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7d5df824-63fd-4047-821b-cdb6e76c3f68","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"```styled`\n  margin: ${getSizeValue(1)}\n````\nみたいな感じです？","ts":"1635581383.220500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VApa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"48C475D3-4F34-43B7-A67F-F7D884CE6E52","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"Spectrum 使ってますがこんな関数を作って値を取得しています。\n\n```export function getSizeValue(value?: DimensionValue) {\n  if (!value) return undefined;\n  return `var(--spectrum-global-dimension-${value})`;\n}```","ts":"1635579662.219800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4mCAD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a2fd740e-25f0-45cb-93cf-2463ef7a665e","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あとstyledとこの辺のpropsでスタイルを指定するときにどうやって使い分けてるか気になっています","ts":"1635578053.218800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zL9x"}]},{"client_msg_id":"172de078-980e-4c50-acee-72af63ba2ad6","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"例えばchakraで1 = 4pxって設定したときにstyledの中で1を参照する方法とか\nこの辺併用してthemeで取り出せるんですっけ","ts":"1635577993.217900","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1635578000.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_